space $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d(x,\\overset{^}{x}) & =‖x-\\overset{^}{x}‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{({x}_{1}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{1})^{2}+({x}_{2}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{2})^{2}+({x}_{3}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(0-0)^{2}+(1-0)^{2}+(1-0)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Note:** The fact that we got the zero-vector as the projection means that $x$ is orthogonal to the subspace $S.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348459 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348459 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348459 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "008be6d7-980e-5b49-a388-3e4f48435f7c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348629 #edb/ref 1080 "{7.18}^{∘}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348629 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348629 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "161688a0-a709-5d07-bc9b-90b1366c3e11" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348725 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348725 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348725 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "205b1754-05a1-59b8-93b0-db0ef3962104" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348890 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\pi }{5}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348890 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348890 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "31df133b-9ac7-5b6c-8dfb-2ea8b930102f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348947 #edb/ref 1080 "{48.59}^{∘}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348947 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186348947 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "377eaa42-8c8a-5e18-9868-47c039dc8b50" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186349194 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\frac{9}{2}\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186349194 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186349194 #edb/re